---
ogImage: "/assets/img/og/lead-response.jpg"
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Missed Call Text Back for Contractors | Couch & Craft"
description: "When you can't pick up, callers get a text in seconds and a way to book. Built for HVAC, plumbing, electrical and roofing."
crumb: "Lead Response"
service:
  name: "Missed call text back"
  type: "Lead response"
  description: "When a contractor can't pick up, the caller gets a text in seconds and a way to book."
cta: false
---
{%- set lr = leadResponse -%}
<p class="notice-strip">
  <span class="container">{{ site.business.formerName }} is now part of {{ site.business.name }}. Same service, new name.</span>
</p>

<section class="page-hero band--navy" aria-labelledby="page-heading">
  <div class="container page-hero__inner flow">
    <p class="eyebrow">For {{ lr.trades | join(" · ") }}</p>
    <h1 id="page-heading">Every missed call is a job you already paid for.</h1>
    <p class="page-hero__sub">When you can't pick up, the caller gets a text back in seconds and a way to book. No office hire.</p>
    <p class="hero__actions">
      <a class="button button--gold" href="#setup" data-track="cta_click" data-label="lead-response-hero">Book a setup call</a>
      <a class="button button--secondary" href="/tools/missed-revenue-calculator/">Get the free calculator</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band call-board-section" aria-labelledby="board-heading">
  <div class="container flow" style="--flow-space: var(--space-l)">
    <h2 id="board-heading">Same three calls. Two different outcomes.</h2>
    <div class="call-board">
      <div class="call-board__col call-board__col--before">
        <p class="call-board__label">Before · Voicemail</p>
        <ul class="call-board__list">
          {%- for call in lr.before %}
          <li class="call-board__call"><span class="call-board__who">{{ call.who }}</span><span class="call-board__what">{{ call.what }}</span><span class="call-board__when">{{ call.when }}</span></li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
        <p class="call-board__result">3 jobs gone to the next contractor.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="call-board__col call-board__col--after">
        <p class="call-board__label">After · Text back in seconds</p>
        <ul class="call-board__list">
          {%- for call in lr.after %}
          <li class="call-board__call"><span class="call-board__who">{{ call.who }}</span><span class="call-board__what">{{ call.what }}</span><span class="call-board__when">{{ call.when }}</span></li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
        <p class="call-board__result">3 jobs on your calendar.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="call-board__note">Illustrative example. Names and numbers are made up.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--white" aria-labelledby="how-heading">
  <div class="container flow" style="--flow-space: var(--space-l)">
    <h2 id="how-heading">How a missed call becomes a booked job</h2>
    <ol class="how-steps">
      {%- for step in lr.steps %}
      <li class="how-steps__item"><h3>{{ step.title }}</h3><p>{{ step.text }}</p></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ol>
    <p class="integrations">{{ site.leadResponse.integrations | open }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" aria-labelledby="trades-heading">
  <div class="container flow" style="--flow-space: var(--space-l)">
    <h2 id="trades-heading">Set up for how your trade gets calls</h2>
    <dl class="trades">
      {%- for row in lr.tradeRows %}
      <div class="trades__row"><dt>{{ row.trade }}</dt><dd>{{ row.text }}</dd></div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--white" aria-labelledby="calc-heading">
  <div class="container calc-cta">
    <div class="flow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Free</p>
      <h2 id="calc-heading">How much are missed calls costing you?</h2>
      <p>Plug in a few numbers you already know and see your monthly loss in dollars. Takes about ten minutes.</p>
      <p><a class="button" href="/tools/missed-revenue-calculator/" data-track="cta_click" data-label="lead-response-calculator">Get the calculator</a></p>
    </div>
    <nav class="compare-links" aria-labelledby="compare-heading">
      <h3 id="compare-heading">Comparing options?</h3>
      <ul>
        {%- for item in lr.compare %}
        <li><a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.title }}</a></li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="setup" aria-labelledby="setup-heading">
  <div class="container home-form__inner">
    <div class="flow">
      <h2 id="setup-heading">Book a setup call</h2>
      <p>Tell me a little about how calls come in now. I'll show you what the text back would look like for your business.</p>
      <p>See <a href="/pricing/">pricing</a> or <a href="/work/">the sites I've built</a>.</p>
    </div>
    {% set form = { id: "setup-form", type: "lead-response", preselect: "I'm missing calls", submitLabel: "Book my setup call" } %}
    {% include "partials/form.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
